  "2026-10-23T21:05:16.441Z",codex-agent,"Two independent behavioural reverts proved the fixes: (1) restoring only the maximization comparison in source makes node --test --test-name-pattern=\"policy regressions respect\" test/policy-card.test.ts fail 1/1 with ERR_ASSERTION (reward_regression incorrectly emitted for minimizing improvement); (2) removing only the in-lock validatePromotedPolicyCard call makes node --test --test-name-pattern=\"prospective promoted card overflow\" test/policy-card.test.ts fail 1/1 with ERR_ASSERTION because candidate body changed to promoted despite card_limit. Each exited 1; production source restored in finally; test SHA-256 unchanged. Restored direction scenarios passed 1/1 and overflow passed 1/1: two failed attempts preserve body/status/updated_at/card digest, then a smaller candidate consumes the same one-unit approval and retains a replayable promoted card. Tests import source; dist is untracked."
  "2026-10-23T21:05:33.229Z",codex-agent,"Pinned pm test pm-rl-policycards --run --only-last --progress passed both new regressions, 2/2, zero failures/skips/cancellations, in its snapshot workspace with PM context none. Full release gate is running with isolated HOME and global/system Git configuration disabled, Node 26, at the unchanged four 100-percent thresholds. npm ci completed with zero audit vulnerabilities. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, duplication (zero clones across 51 files), docstrings (378 declarations), and changelog generation/check passed. No CodeRabbit finding was available to reject; no GitHub review thread exists to reply to or resolve."
  "2026-10-23T21:26:57.545Z",codex-agent,"Bun release gate passed in CI run 40024257594 at code head 28ca37cd221267a9ee5d62cb574e57f743f971a4: bun run release:check, Node 26, 763/763 tests, zero failures/skips, all 51 source files at 100 percent statements/lines/branches/functions. Strict tracker health, typecheck/build, lint, zero duplication, 378 documented declarations, publish attestation, identity audit, zero production vulnerabilities, pack dry run and changelog check passed. CodeQL passed in run 40024257587. npm Node 22/26 jobs remain running. Stopped the duplicate local npm gate intentionally after 127 reported passing cases and no reported failure to reduce shared host load; no local full-gate pass is claimed."
  "2026-10-23T21:34:58.134Z",codex-agent,"Complete unchanged release gates passed at code head 28ca37cd221267a9ee5d62cb574e57f743f971a4 in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/40024257594 : npm run release:check on Node 22 and Node 26 and bun run release:check on Node 26 each passed 763/763 tests, zero failures/skips. All 51 source files measured 100 percent statements/lines/branches/functions in each job. Strict tracker health, identity and production audits, lint/duplication/docstrings, build, publish attestation, package dry run and changelog checks passed. CodeQL passed. Both new regressions passed 2/2 through pinned pm test, and both independent behavioural reverts failed 1/1 with ERR_ASSERTION as recorded above. No timeout or failure occurred in these full CI runs; the duplicate local gate was intentionally stopped and is not a full pass. No new review threads appeared. Final follow-up commit contains tracker receipts only; no code change after full CI acceptance. The item remains in progress for orchestrator verification; no merge, release, review reply or thread resolution."
  "2026-10-23T21:50:37.110Z",codex-agent,"Third independent review confirmed both blockers: replay accepts unrelated certified citations and registration validates limits after generation/history creation. GraphQL returned zero review threads (no pagination); no CodeRabbit review body exists, and its issue comment records automatic review skipped. Plan: bind historical citations to the certified subject dependency graph, preflight complete cards before durable writes, audit every added write including receipts and budgets, and prove refusal atomicity with complete tracker byte snapshots plus independent behavioural reverts. Earlier fixes remain required. Remote branch is current and contains main; no merge needed."
  "2026-10-23T21:58:27.907Z",codex-agent,"Write-boundary audit found additional instances: batch card publication could write a shared card before a selected-card collision; outer recursive phase receipts and checkpoint artifacts were persisted before card-limit checks; rejection notes/comments and recovery closes also needed preflight. These now validate before the associated durable write. Promotion retains its authoritative in-lock validation and gains a pre-journal check. Registration defers schema initialization too. Snapshot tests include all durable domain/history/budget/artifact/journal files; the pinned SDK unconditionally appends derived runtime/context-usage.jsonl on ordinary get calls, and active controller locks renew, so only that derived ledger and ephemeral locks are explicitly excluded. This SDK read-side effect is a concrete UX gap; no telemetry setting or SDK dependency changed."
  "2026-10-23T22:00:09.924Z",codex-agent,"Focused regression run passed 6/6 with zero failures, cancellations or skips: unrelated certified citation forgery, both registration bounds, pre-journal promotion overflow and unchanged approval capacity, batch collision before partial publication, recursive receipt plus checkpoint publication preflight, and rejection-note preflight. Both count and byte-limit registration refusals were retried twice. Every refusal comparison enumerates and compares all durable files, including histories and transaction/artifact receipts, with the two explicitly documented SDK-derived exclusions. The write inventory is docs/policy-card-write-audit.md. Behavioural reverts and full unchanged npm/Bun release gates are next."
  "2026-10-23T22:03:39.871Z",codex-agent,"Seven isolated function-only revert cases are being exercised on text-only source copies with the same pinned SDK and unchanged regression file: foreign citation validation, registration preflight, pre-journal promotion check, batch collision preflight, receipt intent deferral, artifact pre-publication validation, and rejection-note validation. The first five already fail with ERR_ASSERTION as required. Final self-review also excludes allowances from plans and comparison receipts (they do not declare resource budgets), and rejects extra wrapper fields on the pinned Plan. The initial local npm gate was stopped before its test run to include this final hardening; no full pass is claimed for that superseded run. New baseline gates will run on frozen source."
  "2026-10-23T22:04:29.499Z",codex-agent,"All seven behavioural reverts failed 1/1 with ERR_ASSERTION, exit 1, while the regression file hash stayed unchanged within each source-only reversion. Cases: foreign-citation allowlist, registration preflight, pre-journal promotion preflight, batch collision preflight, receipt intent deferral, artifact pre-publication callback, rejection-note preflight. Each modified production file was restored in finally. Source-based tests need no dist rebuild; dist is untracked and rebuilt by release gates. Literal full-file equality is separately tracked by pm-rl-readusage because current SDK reads append a derived usage ledger. Full isolated-identity tracker health passed; default HOME health reports a local pm-github host-version skew, without history drift. The pinned pm test metadata update also refuses guarded item-format 2 because the existing peer floor includes older hosts; no pin or history was changed. Runtime context and timeout overrides are being used for the required pm test runner."
  "2026-10-23T22:07:47.684Z",codex-agent,"Required pinned PM execution passed: pm test pm-rl-policycards --run --only-last --progress --timeout 600 --pm-context none --override-linked-pm-context --workspace-context snapshot --override-linked-workspace-context ran the six-boundary regression command successfully, 6/6 tests with zero failures/skips/cancellations, exit 0, 214.256 seconds. This follows an unrelated default-schema initialization refusal; the explicit supported runtime context override is the successful evidence. TypeScript source and test typechecks passed. The full npm release gate is measuring the frozen source; Bun and Node floor acceptance will also run through the existing CI matrix."
  "2026-10-23T22:09:48.387Z",codex-agent,"Final hardening proofs complete: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"generation citations\" test/policy-card.test.ts passes 1/1 on restored current source, including foreign candidate/incumbent/comparison/deployment identities, malformed bindings, a rehashed budget-injection attempt in the Plan wrapper, and ignored numeric allowances in comparison evidence. Removing only the Plan-wrapper guard fails 1/1 with ERR_ASSERTION; restoring allowances from non-declaration records independently fails 1/1 with ERR_ASSERTION. Together with the repeated seven write-boundary reverts on the final source, all nine production-only reverts exited 1 as required, with unchanged regression-file hashes and immediate finally restoration. Exact revert commands and behaviors are listed in docs/policy-card-write-audit.md. Full npm/Bun CI is required on the pushed source; local npm gate is still running."
  "2026-10-23T22:15:04.199Z",codex-agent,"Final edge-case self-review found that an offline plan with no declared shadow digest could admit a named shadow-comparison receipt when both comparison values were undefined. Tightening the comparison binding to require an actual string identity, with real certified unrelated receipt injection tested on both export and historical replay. This changes no allowance or promotion authority, but closes the citation-graph contract fully. The full gates for the previous source are superseded; the corrected source will receive a fresh exact-head matrix. Also adding the missing-source-body typed-refusal branch to maintain unchanged full coverage."
  "2026-10-23T22:18:19.365Z",codex-agent,"Tenth independent revert proof passed: the final generation-citations baseline passes 1/1, including an offline plan with no shadow declaration and a certified unrelated Decision placed at its derived shadow-comparison id. Both export and a rehashed historical replay refuse with typed card_drift and unchanged durable tracker bytes. Removing only typeof comparison !== string makes this same regression fail 1/1 with ERR_ASSERTION, exit 1; the test hash stays unchanged and the source copy is restored in finally. The missing-source-body refusal also passes 1/1. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, zero duplication and 383 documented declarations pass. The superseded local npm run and first matrix were intentionally stopped for this correction; they are not release acceptance or timeout evidence. Final source now receives a fresh npm/Bun matrix."
  "2026-10-23T22:43:27.407Z",codex-agent,"Exact source 441750a69761939efad152a0e3e186486c86b961 passed both complete npm release gates in CI run 40032777921: Node 22 and Node 26 each report 768/768 tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips, and all 51 source files at 100 percent statements, lines, branches and functions. Both preserve unchanged thresholds and pass build/typecheck/lint, zero duplication, 383 documented declarations, publish attestation, identity audit, zero production vulnerabilities, package dry run and changelog check. CodeQL run 40032777894 passed. Bun is the remaining pending gate; no final release acceptance is claimed until it finishes."
  "2026-10-23T22:52:53.405Z",codex-agent,"Final acceptance: CI run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/40032777921 passed all three complete isolated-identity release gates on source head 441750a69761939efad152a0e3e186486c86b961. npm run release:check on Node 22 and Node 26, and bun run release:check on Node 26 each passed 768/768 tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips. All 51 authored source files measured 100 percent statements, lines, branches and functions at unchanged thresholds. Build/typecheck/lint, zero duplication, 383 documented declarations, publish attestation, identity audit, zero production vulnerabilities, package dry run, changelog and strict tracker health passed. CodeQL run 40032777894 passed on the same source. Ten production-only behavioural reverts failed 1/1 as required; the pinned PM snapshot runner passed 6/6 focused tests, and the final lineage/injection baseline passed 1/1. Earlier local gates and the superseded matrix were intentionally canceled for source corrections, not timeouts; no local full-gate pass is claimed. The default PM test context failure passed on supported none/snapshot runtime override. Final GraphQL read still returns zero review threads and no CodeRabbit review body. Durable-state snapshot exclusions and SDK read-side-effect limitation remain explicit in pm-rl-readusage; no dependency bump, history rewrite, review reply, resolution, merge or release. The final follow-up commit contains only these tracker receipts and claim release; its source is identical to the fully certified source head."
  "2026-10-23T23:00:52.523Z",codex-agent,"Review round d: remote head is current and includes main. GitHub GraphQL returned zero review threads (no pagination); all paginated PR reviews contain no CodeRabbit review. Confirmed blocker: mutable updated_at changes promoted citation coordinates. Audit all card digest and provenance inputs; add non-git lifecycle mutation and policy-drift regressions with behavioral revert proofs, retaining prior boundary tests and unchanged release thresholds."
  "2026-10-23T23:05:30.601Z",codex-agent,"Implemented content-only projections and first matching certified history-version citations, excluding tracker status, annotations and mirror metadata. Sealed policy_evaluation now belongs to the Generation body instead of mutable notes; rejection writes preflight the complete outcome before an idempotent body update. Added real-promotion mutation/adoption and independent policy-change regressions; expanded docs/policy-card-write-audit.md with every new digest and transitive provenance input. Overflow fixtures are recalibrated for shorter immutable version locators; byte/citation limits and coverage thresholds are unchanged."
  "2026-10-23T23:07:47.718Z",codex-agent,"Self-review found the SDK clears Run fixed_version on terminal-to-active status changes; excluded that duplicate metadata because the Run body already seals configuration. Prospective outcome validation now reserves the maximum safe-integer history-version width, preserving pre-write overflow refusal even when a new policy version crosses a digit boundary. The mutation matrix covers Run status transitions and reserved-looking native notes as well as subject/seed/approval/environment/card annotations."
  "2026-10-23T23:11:30.533Z",codex-agent,"Round-d behavioral revert proofs completed in an isolated text-only source copy against the pinned SDK; regression file SHA-256 unchanged before/after each run and production restored in finally. Reverting only snapshot to its previous timestamp selector (restoring its required updated_at read field) fails both new tests: routine mutations fail ERR_ASSERTION after the first comment changes the fresh digest; policy relevant changes fail card_missing_provenance when exact content is restored and fresh adoption loses the retained card (2/2 failed, exit 1). Reintroducing only the former domain dependency on native evaluation notes (and its required note read field) fails the mutation test at the reserved-looking note, ERR_ASSERTION, 1/1 failed, exit 1. Restored production passed the pinned PM snapshot runner: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"routine tracker mutation|policy relevant changes|citation reads require|concurrent policy replacement\" test/policy-card.test.ts, 4/4 passed, zero failures/skips/cancellations, exit 0, 55.449 seconds. Real SDK history-projection and concurrent compaction tests also passed directly 2/2. Full release coverage remains running; no final gate pass is claimed yet."
  "2026-10-23T23:12:16.235Z",codex-agent,"Additional read-only GitHub inspection confirms CodeRabbit has only an issue-comment receipt saying automatic review was skipped, not a submitted review or outside-diff finding. No review-thread disposition is missing. Existing runner context issue is avoided through the supported none/snapshot override; no new pm CLI/SDK defect was observed. Dist is untracked and rebuilt locally by TypeScript gates."
  "2026-10-23T23:16:07.904Z",codex-agent,"Focused policy-card suite passed 26/26 with no failures/skips/cancellations. Its coverage isolated a successful rejection-return path only exercised elsewhere by the full suite; added a direct real-tracker regression for sealed rejection publication and byte-identical idempotent retry. The new test passed directly 1/1 and through the pinned PM snapshot runner 1/1 (exit 0). Source and test typecheck, lint, zero duplication across 51 source files, 383 docstrings, changelog generation/check and isolated-identity strict tracker health pass. The follow-up changes tests and tracker receipts only; full npm/Bun CI runs remain pending, with no full gate pass claimed."
